        <h1>Perugia <em>ZTL</em> map, hours and where to park</h1>
        <p class="lede">Perugia's restricted hours run the opposite way to most people's expectations. The zone over the walled centre is active from midnight until one in the afternoon on weekdays — the whole morning — and reopens for the afternoon and evening. At weekends and on public holidays it lifts at seven. Visitors who assume Italian centres close in the evening and are open by day have it precisely backwards here, and arrive mid-morning into a live camera gate. Not every gate keeps to that timetable, so the afternoon opening is the main zone's, not the whole city's.</p>
